{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create one NEW complete Limited deals slider block. Do not alter/delete existing blocks. Build all features together, using simple reliable responsive code and working editable settings. English UI. Heading 'Halloween Dash Cam Flash Deals'. Subtitle 'Limited-time dash cam deals, plus an extra $10 OFF orders $100+, $15 OFF $150+, or $20 OFF $200+.' Preserve this existing merchant copy without adding checkout promises. Heading/subtitle top-left. ONE countdown top-right: EXACTLY FOUR background tiles, one for Days, one Hours, one Minutes, one Seconds. Each tile contains the COMPLETE two-digit number on ONE background, with small unit label beneath INSIDE that same tile. Example [10 Days] [13 Hours] [06 Minutes] [35 Seconds]. NEVER split digits into8 tiles. Label 'Ends in' above. End2026-10-31T23:59:59+08:00. Digit font28, tile minimum48px, padding8, radius6, digit#111111/background#fff001. Editable end/timezone,label,unit labels,font,tile dimensions,padding,radius and independent colors. Compact four-tile row, no mobile overlaps. Module background#f8f9fd text#111111 card#ffffff width100%. Up to5 individually selectable collections. Seed1 collection gid://shopify/Collection/513284210915 handle halloween-sale-save-40, heading 'Halloween Deals: 40% OFF', discount40, custom badge '40% OFF', destination empty. Seed2 gid://shopify/Collection/513284178147 handle halloween-sale-save-35, heading 'More Halloween Deals: 35% OFF', discount35, custom badge empty, destination shopify://pages/halloween-dash-cam-sale page gid://shopify/Page/167282802915. Slots3–5 empty, discounts30/25/20, hidden until selected. Each collection SINGLE horizontal product row, desktop4/mobile2 per view, independent arrows/touch swiping, editable counts. CRITICAL correct card price calculation: choose same selected_or_first_available_variant for original and discounted price. In Liquid use separate assigns: remaining_percent = 100 | minus: collection_discount; discounted_price = variant.price | times: remaining_percent | divided_by: 100.0 | round. Do not multiply currency subunits by100 again. Format via money. 40% OFF:169.99 must become101.99;129.99 must become77.99.35% OFF:100 becomes65. Original current selling price crossed out next to computed price; do not use compare_at_price as base.0% shows normal price only. Badge text must not affect calculation. This is display only, no checkout discount or product-record changes. Top-left product badge custom text per collection or percentage fallback; independent editable text#111111/background#fff001/border#fff001/width0. Product cards image,title,price and 'Shop now' button to product. Editable product button label/background#fff001/text#111111/border#111111/width0/hover background#f2c615/hover text#111111. Separate bottom-left button below EACH COLLECTION: 'Explore More Deals→', independent per-collection editable destination, internal/external links; empty link hides button. Separate collection button background#fff001/text#111111/border#111111/width1 controls, button radius8. Expose all listed settings and seed exact resources/content/links where supported. Match original theme visual style. Before presenting validate: exactly4 countdown tiles not8, correct discount price test cases, product and collection buttons distinct, independent colors, all editor controls connected.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.module_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};padding:24px;border-radius:12px;box-sizing:border-box}
.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}
.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;margin-bottom:24px}
.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{flex:1;min-width:0}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 8px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__subtitle{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer{flex:0 0 auto;text-align:left}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-label{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 7px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax({{ block.settings.tile_min_width }}px,1fr));gap:6px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile{min-width:{{ block.settings.tile_min_width }}px;padding:{{ block.settings.tile_padding }}px;background:{{ block.settings.tile_bg }};border-radius:{{ block.settings.tile_radius }}px;text-align:center;color:{{ block.settings.tile_digit_color }}}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number{display:block;font-size:{{ block.settings.digit_size }}px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:700}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit{display:block;font-size:10px;line-height:1.2;margin-top:3px}
.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection{margin-top:26px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-title{font-size:22px;margin:0}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls{display:flex;gap:8px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid #111;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;color:#111;font-size:20px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible,.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #005fcc;outline-offset:3px}
.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:14px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-padding-left:1px;scroll-behavior:smooth;padding:2px 1px 10px;scrollbar-width:thin}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{position:relative;flex:0 0 calc((100% - 42px)/4);min-width:0;scroll-snap-align:start;background:{{ block.settings.card_bg }};border-radius:10px;padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;top:18px;left:18px;z-index:1;background:{{ block.settings.badge_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.badge_text }};border:{{ block.settings.badge_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.badge_border }};border-radius:4px;padding:4px 7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;background:#f1f1f1;border-radius:8px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title{font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;margin:10px 0 7px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__old{font-size:13px;text-decoration:line-through;opacity:.7}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__new{font-size:17px;font-weight:700}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-button,.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__explore{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:10px 14px;line-height:1.25;transition:background-color .15s ease,color .15s ease}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-button{margin-top:auto;background:{{ block.settings.product_btn_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.product_btn_text }};border:{{ block.settings.product_btn_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.product_btn_border }};border-radius:6px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-button:hover{background:{{ block.settings.product_btn_hover_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.product_btn_hover_text }}}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__explore{margin-top:14px;background:{{ block.settings.collection_btn_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.collection_btn_text }};border:{{ block.settings.collection_btn_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.collection_btn_border }};border-radius:{{ block.settings.collection_btn_radius }}px}
@media(max-width:749px){.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:16px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top{flex-direction:column;gap:18px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer{width:100%}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile{min-width:0;padding:{{ block.settings.tile_padding }}px 3px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number{font-size:min({{ block.settings.digit_size }}px,7vw)}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 14px)/2);padding:9px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-title{font-size:19px}.ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{top:14px;left:14px;font-size:11px}}
{% endstyle %}
<limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-end="{{ block.settings.end_time | escape }}" data-zone="{{ block.settings.timezone | escape }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top"><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro"><h2 class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2><p class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__subtitle">{{ block.settings.subtitle | escape }}</p></div><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer" aria-label="Countdown"><p class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-label">{{ block.settings.timer_label | escape }}</p><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-grid"><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile"><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number" data-days>00</span><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit">{{ block.settings.days_label | escape }}</span></div><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile"><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number" data-hours>00</span><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit">{{ block.settings.hours_label | escape }}</span></div><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile"><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number" data-minutes>00</span><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit">{{ block.settings.minutes_label | escape }}</span></div><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile"><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number" data-seconds>00</span><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit">{{ block.settings.seconds_label | escape }}</span></div></div></div></div>
{% for i in (1..5) %}{% liquid
assign collection_key = 'collection_' | append: i
assign heading_key = 'collection_heading_' | append: i
assign discount_key = 'discount_' | append: i
assign badge_key = 'custom_badge_' | append: i
assign destination_key = 'destination_' | append: i
assign count_key = 'products_per_view_' | append: i
assign deal_collection = block.settings[collection_key]
assign deal_heading = block.settings[heading_key]
assign deal_discount = block.settings[discount_key]
assign deal_badge = block.settings[badge_key]
assign deal_destination = block.settings[destination_key]
assign deal_count = block.settings[count_key]
if i == 1 and deal_collection == blank
assign deal_collection = collections['halloween-sale-save-40']
endif
if i == 2 and deal_collection == blank
assign deal_collection = collections['halloween-sale-save-35']
endif
if i == 2 and deal_destination == blank
assign deal_destination = '/pages/halloween-dash-cam-sale'
endif
%}{% if deal_collection != blank %}{% assign deal_id = ai_gen_id | append: '-' | append: i %}<section class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection" data-slider="{{ deal_id }}"><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-head"><h3 class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-title">{{ deal_heading | default: deal_collection.title | escape }}</h3><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls"><button type="button" class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" data-prev aria-label="Previous products">‹</button><button type="button" class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" data-next aria-label="Next products">›</button></div></div><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>{% for product in deal_collection.products %}{% assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}{% assign remaining_percent = 100 | minus: deal_discount %}{% assign discounted_price = variant.price | times: remaining_percent | divided_by: 100.0 | round %}<article class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">{% if deal_badge != blank %}{% assign badge_label = deal_badge %}{% else %}{% assign badge_label = deal_discount | append: '% OFF' %}{% endif %}<span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ badge_label | escape }}</span><a href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">{% if product.featured_image %}<img class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image" src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">{% else %}<div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}</a><a class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title" href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title | escape }}</a><div class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices">{% if deal_discount > 0 %}<span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__old">{{ variant.price | money }}</span><span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__new">{{ discounted_price | money }}</span>{% else %}<span class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__new">{{ variant.price | money }}</span>{% endif %}</div><a class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-button" href="{{ product.url }}">{{ block.settings.product_button_label | escape }}</a></article>{% endfor %}</div>{% if deal_destination != blank %}<a class="ai-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__explore" href="{{ deal_destination }}">{{ block.settings.collection_button_label | escape }} →</a>{% endif %}</section>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){class LimitedDeals{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){if(this.dataset.ready)return;this.dataset.ready='true';const end=new Date(this.dataset.end);const update=()=>{let left=Math.max(0,end.getTime()-Date.now());const values={days:Math.floor(left/86400000),hours:Math.floor(left%86400000/3600000),minutes:Math.floor(left%3600000/60000),seconds:Math.floor(left%60000/1000)};Object.keys(values).forEach(k=>{const el=this.querySelector('[data-'+k+']');if(el)el.textContent=String(values[k]).padStart(2,'0')})};update();this.timer=setInterval(update,1000);this.querySelectorAll('[data-slider]').forEach(section=>{const track=section.querySelector('[data-track]');section.querySelector('[data-prev]').addEventListener('click',()=>track.scrollBy({left:-track.clientWidth,behavior:'smooth'}));section.querySelector('[data-next]').addEventListener('click',()=>track.scrollBy({left:track.clientWidth,behavior:'smooth'}))})}disconnectedCallback(){clearInterval(this.timer)}}if(!customElements.get('limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}'))customElements.define('limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}',LimitedDeals{{ ai_gen_id }})})();</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"Limited deals slider","tag":null,"class":"limited-deals-block","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"header","content":"Header and colors"},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Halloween Dash Cam Flash Deals"},{"type":"text","id":"subtitle","label":"Subtitle","default":"Limited-time dash cam deals, plus an extra $10 OFF orders $100+, $15 OFF $150+, or $20 OFF $200+."},{"type":"color","id":"module_bg","label":"Module background","default":"#f8f9fd"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#111111"},{"type":"color","id":"card_bg","label":"Card background","default":"#ffffff"},{"type":"header","content":"Countdown"},{"type":"text","id":"end_time","label":"End date and time with timezone","default":"2026-10-31T23:59:59+08:00"},{"type":"text","id":"timezone","label":"Timezone label","default":"Asia/Shanghai"},{"type":"text","id":"timer_label","label":"Timer label","default":"Ends in"},{"type":"text","id":"days_label","label":"Days label","default":"Days"},{"type":"text","id":"hours_label","label":"Hours label","default":"Hours"},{"type":"text","id":"minutes_label","label":"Minutes label","default":"Minutes"},{"type":"text","id":"seconds_label","label":"Seconds label","default":"Seconds"},{"type":"range","id":"digit_size","label":"Digit font size","min":20,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":28},{"type":"range","id":"tile_min_width","label":"Tile minimum width","min":48,"max":80,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":48},{"type":"range","id":"tile_padding","label":"Tile padding","min":4,"max":16,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":8},{"type":"range","id":"tile_radius","label":"Tile radius","min":0,"max":16,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":6},{"type":"color","id":"tile_bg","label":"Tile background","default":"#fff001"},{"type":"color","id":"tile_digit_color","label":"Tile digits and labels","default":"#111111"},{"type":"header","content":"Product badges"},{"type":"text","id":"custom_badge_1","label":"Collection 1 badge","default":"40% OFF"},{"type":"text","id":"custom_badge_2","label":"Collection 2 badge","default":"Save on dash cams"},{"type":"text","id":"custom_badge_3","label":"Collection 3 badge","default":"Limited deal"},{"type":"text","id":"custom_badge_4","label":"Collection 4 badge","default":"Limited deal"},{"type":"text","id":"custom_badge_5","label":"Collection 5 badge","default":"Limited deal"},{"type":"color","id":"badge_text","label":"Badge text","default":"#111111"},{"type":"color","id":"badge_bg","label":"Badge background","default":"#fff001"},{"type":"color","id":"badge_border","label":"Badge border","default":"#fff001"},{"type":"range","id":"badge_border_width","label":"Badge border width","min":0,"max":4,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":0},{"type":"header","content":"Product buttons"},{"type":"text","id":"product_button_label","label":"Product button label","default":"Shop now"},{"type":"color","id":"product_btn_bg","label":"Background","default":"#fff001"},{"type":"color","id":"product_btn_text","label":"Text","default":"#111111"},{"type":"color","id":"product_btn_border","label":"Border","default":"#111111"},{"type":"range","id":"product_btn_border_width","label":"Border width","min":0,"max":4,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":0},{"type":"color","id":"product_btn_hover_bg","label":"Hover background","default":"#f2c615"},{"type":"color","id":"product_btn_hover_text","label":"Hover text","default":"#111111"},{"type":"header","content":"Collection buttons"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_button_label","label":"Button label","default":"Explore More Deals"},{"type":"color","id":"collection_btn_bg","label":"Background","default":"#fff001"},{"type":"color","id":"collection_btn_text","label":"Text","default":"#111111"},{"type":"color","id":"collection_btn_border","label":"Border","default":"#111111"},{"type":"range","id":"collection_btn_border_width","label":"Border width","min":0,"max":4,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":1},{"type":"range","id":"collection_btn_radius","label":"Button radius","min":0,"max":20,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":8},{"type":"header","content":"Collection 1"},{"type":"collection","id":"collection_1","label":"Collection"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_heading_1","label":"Heading","default":"Halloween Deals: 40% OFF"},{"type":"range","id":"discount_1","label":"Discount percentage","min":0,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":40},{"type":"url","id":"destination_1","label":"Explore destination"},{"type":"range","id":"products_per_view_1","label":"Products per view","min":2,"max":4,"step":1,"default":4},{"type":"header","content":"Collection 2"},{"type":"collection","id":"collection_2","label":"Collection"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_heading_2","label":"Heading","default":"More Halloween Deals: 35% OFF"},{"type":"range","id":"discount_2","label":"Discount percentage","min":0,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":35},{"type":"url","id":"destination_2","label":"Explore destination"},{"type":"range","id":"products_per_view_2","label":"Products per view","min":2,"max":4,"step":1,"default":4},{"type":"header","content":"Collection 3"},{"type":"collection","id":"collection_3","label":"Collection"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_heading_3","label":"Heading","default":"More deals"},{"type":"range","id":"discount_3","label":"Discount percentage","min":0,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":30},{"type":"url","id":"destination_3","label":"Explore destination"},{"type":"range","id":"products_per_view_3","label":"Products per view","min":2,"max":4,"step":1,"default":4},{"type":"header","content":"Collection 4"},{"type":"collection","id":"collection_4","label":"Collection"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_heading_4","label":"Heading","default":"More deals"},{"type":"range","id":"discount_4","label":"Discount percentage","min":0,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":25},{"type":"url","id":"destination_4","labe